<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, this precious life divine</l><l>Is the Triune God Himself!</l><l>All He is and all He has</l><l>Are all concealed in this life.</l><l>God’s life into my spirit comes,</l><l>Mingling with me in life as one—</l><l>Wisdom, pow’r, holy righteousness</l><l>Are my experience.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The outflow of life divine—</l><l>Manifested in His Son;</l><l>In Him is the life divine,</l><l>Saviour He’s of everyone.</l><l>Life of all lives—unique is He,</l><l>And He released His life to me</l><l>That this life I ever may gain—</l><l>Yes, His life divine!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The release of life divine</l><l>The life-giving Spirit is;</l><l>The working of life divine</l><l>In my spirit operates;</l><l>He is the wonderful ointment</l><l>In my spirit, anointing me</l><l>With His compounded elements—</l><l>Pervading through me.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Oh, this life I treasure so—</l><l>Life divine so wonderful!</l><l>In me this life’s working—so</l><l>Divine, rich and bountiful!</l><l>Salvation great and excellent,</l><l>And it’s all mine to experience;</l><l>Truly, this life is all to me—</l><l>All my life is He.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
